  "notes": "Multi-label intent expectations for the Laya decision router. Business facts are NOT asserted here; only which information kinds a correct retrieval plan needs. SKUs are real catalogue identifiers from data/supplierflow-official-knowledge.md. Ambiguous cases expect a clarification-capable plan (product_discovery, no exact lookup). R25-R36 are development cases (tuning allowed). Held-out cases live in routing-heldout.json and must not be used for tuning.",
